<template>
<div v-if="authReady&&!currentUser" class="auth-screen"><section class="auth-card"><div class="auth-brand"><span class="brand-mark"><PackageCheck :size="22"/></span><div><b>TradeFlow</b><small>ERP 工作台</small></div></div><div class="auth-heading"><div class="eyebrow">{{setupRequired?'首次设置':'安全登录'}}</div><h1>{{setupRequired?'创建管理员账号':'欢迎回来'}}</h1><p>{{setupRequired?'设置第一个管理员账户后即可开始使用。':'登录 TradeFlow ERP 继续管理订单和库存。'}}</p></div><div v-if="setupBlocked" class="auth-error"><CircleAlert :size="15"/>生产服务尚未配置 TRADEFLOW_SETUP_TOKEN。请让部署管理员在服务器 .env 设置初始化口令并重启服务。</div><form v-else class="auth-form" @submit.prevent="submitAuth"><label class="form-label">用户名<input v-model.trim="authForm.username" autocomplete="username" placeholder="至少 3 位字母或数字" required/></label><label v-if="setupRequired&&setupTokenRequired" class="form-label">部署初始化口令<input v-model="authForm.setupToken" type="password" autocomplete="off" placeholder="由部署管理员安全提供" required/><small class="field-hint">此口令只用于首次创建管理员，不是你的登录密码。</small></label><label class="form-label">密码<input v-model="authForm.password" :autocomplete="setupRequired?'new-password':'current-password'" type="password" :placeholder="setupRequired?'至少 12 位':'请输入密码'" required/><small v-if="setupRequired" class="field-hint">首次管理员密码至少 12 位</small></label><label v-if="setupRequired" class="form-label">确认密码<input v-model="authForm.confirmPassword" type="password" autocomplete="new-password" placeholder="再次输入密码" required/></label><p v-if="authError" class="auth-error"><CircleAlert :size="15"/>{{authError}}</p><button class="button button-primary button-full" type="submit">{{setupRequired?'创建管理员并进入':'登录'}}</button></form><p class="auth-footnote"><ShieldCheck :size="14"/>{{DEMO_MODE?'单机演示账号，不提供真实权限隔离':'账户与权限由服务端验证'}}</p></section></div>
<div v-else-if="!authReady" class="auth-screen"><section class="auth-card auth-loading"><span class="brand-mark"><PackageCheck :size="22"/></span><b>正在连接 TradeFlow…</b></section></div>
<div v-else class="app-shell">
  <aside class="sidebar" :class="{'sidebar-open':mobileMenuOpen}">
    <a class="brand" href="#/dashboard" @click="navigate('dashboard')"><span class="brand-mark"><PackageCheck :size="21"/></span><span><b>TradeFlow</b><small>ERP 工作台</small></span></a>
    <div class="workspace-label">工作空间</div><nav class="nav-list"><template v-for="item in navItems" :key="item.id"><button v-if="(item.id!=='users'||currentUser?.role==='admin')&&(!DEMO_MODE||item.id!=='users')" :class="['nav-item',{active:page===item.id||(item.id==='orders'&&page==='order-detail')}]" @click="navigate(item.id)"><component :is="item.icon" :size="18"/><span>{{item.label}}</span><span v-if="item.id==='shipments'&&shipmentOrders.length" class="nav-count">{{shipmentOrders.length}}</span></button></template></nav>
    <div class="sidebar-bottom"><div class="demo-note"><span class="demo-dot"></span><div><b>{{DEMO_MODE?'浏览器演示模式':'本地工作区'}}</b><small>订单和库存数据</small></div><ShieldCheck :size="16"/></div><div class="profile"><div class="avatar">{{currentUser.username.slice(0,1).toUpperCase()}}</div><div class="profile-info"><b>{{currentUser.username}}</b><small>{{currentUser.roleName}}账户</small></div><button v-if="!DEMO_MODE" class="icon-button logout-button" title="退出登录" @click="logout"><LogOut :size="16"/></button></div></div>
  </aside><div v-if="mobileMenuOpen" class="scrim" @click="mobileMenuOpen=false"></div>
  <main class="main-area"><header class="topbar"><div class="topbar-left"><button class="icon-button mobile-menu" @click="mobileMenuOpen=!mobileMenuOpen"><Menu :size="20"/></button><span class="breadcrumb">工作空间</span><ChevronRight :size="14" class="muted"/><span class="breadcrumb-current">{{currentLabel}}</span></div><div class="topbar-right"><button class="workspace-nav-button" :disabled="!workspaceHistory.length" title="返回上一个工作空间" @click="goBackWorkspace"><ArrowLeft :size="16"/><span>返回</span></button><button class="workspace-nav-button" title="返回工作台" @click="navigate('dashboard')"><House :size="16"/><span>工作台</span></button><span class="demo-pill"><span class="demo-dot"></span>{{DEMO_MODE?'本地演示数据':`${currentUser.roleName} · 本地数据`}}</span><button class="icon-button"><CircleHelp :size="18"/></button><div class="avatar top-avatar">{{currentUser.username.slice(0,1).toUpperCase()}}</div></div></header>
  <div v-if="DEMO_MODE" class="demo-mode-banner"><TriangleAlert :size="16"/><span>无需后端的演示模式：数据仅保存在当前浏览器。清除网站数据或更换设备后不会同步，请勿录入真实业务资料。</span></div>
  <section class="page-content"><template v-if="page==='dashboard'"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">{{new Intl.DateTimeFormat("zh-CN",{weekday:"long"}).format(new Date())}} · 运营概览</div><h1>早上好，管理员 <span class="wave">✳</span></h1><p>这是你的店铺今日概况，一切都在顺利运转。</p></div><div class="heading-actions"><button v-if="canOperate" class="button button-secondary" @click="openDemoOrderForm"><Plus :size="16"/>生成待处理订单</button><button class="button button-secondary" @click="navigate('orders')"><ListFilter :size="16"/>查看订单</button></div></div>
    <section class="panel ledger-panel" style="margin-bottom:22px"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2><TriangleAlert :size="17"/> 库存预警</h2><p>{{lowStockProducts.length ? `${lowStockProducts.length} 个在售商品可用库存达到或低于预警阈值` : '当前在售商品库存充足'}}</p></div><button class="text-button" @click="navigate('inventory')">查看库存 <ArrowRight :size="14"/></button></div><div v-if="lowStockProducts.length" class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>商品</th><th>SKU</th><th>可用库存</th><th>预警阈值</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="product in lowStockProducts.slice(0,5)" :key="product.sku"><td><b>{{product.name}}</b></td><td class="mono">{{product.sku}}</td><td><b class="low-stock-text">{{product.available}} 件</b></td><td>{{product.threshold}} 件</td><td><span class="status-badge status-processing"><i></i>{{product.available===0?'缺货':'库存偏低'}}</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div v-else class="empty-state compact"><CircleCheck :size="23"/><span>没有需要补货的在售商品</span></div></section>
    <div class="stats-grid"><article v-for="stat in dashboardStats" :key="stat.label" class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>{{stat.label}}</span><span class="stat-icon" :class="stat.tone"><component :is="stat.icon" :size="17"/></span></div><div class="stat-value">{{stat.value}}</div><div class="stat-foot"><span :class="stat.changeTone">{{stat.change}}</span><span>{{stat.caption}}</span></div></article></div>
    <div class="dashboard-grid"><section class="panel recent-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>近期订单</h2><p>跟进最新订单的处理进度</p></div><button class="text-button" @click="navigate('orders')">全部订单 <ArrowRight :size="14"/></button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>订单</th><th>店铺</th><th>商品件数</th><th>金额</th><th>状态</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="order in recentOrders" :key="order.id" class="clickable-row" @click="openOrder(order.id)"><td><b class="mono">{{order.id}}</b><small class="cell-sub">{{formatShortDate(order.date)}}</small></td><td><span class="store-cell">手动录入</span></td><td>{{itemCount(order)}} 件</td><td class="amount">{{money(order.total)}}</td><td><span :class="['status-badge',statusClass(order.status)]"><i></i>{{statusLabel(order.status)}}</span></td><td><ChevronRight :size="16" class="muted"/></td></tr></tbody></table></div><button class="mobile-all-link" @click="navigate('orders')">查看全部订单 <ArrowRight :size="15"/></button></section>
    <section class="panel action-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>待办事项</h2><p>优先处理这些订单</p></div><span class="task-mark"><Sparkles :size="15"/></span></div><button class="task-card" @click="navigate('orders','processing')"><span class="task-icon amber"><ClipboardCheck :size="18"/></span><span class="task-copy"><b>确认待处理订单</b><small>检查信息并准备发货</small></span><span class="task-count">{{countStatus('processing')}}</span><ChevronRight :size="15" class="muted"/></button><button class="task-card" @click="navigate('shipments')"><span class="task-icon violet"><Truck :size="18"/></span><span class="task-copy"><b>处理待发货订单</b><small>补充物流信息并发货</small></span><span class="task-count">{{countStatus('ready')}}</span><ChevronRight :size="15" class="muted"/></button><div class="tip-card"><div class="tip-title"><Lightbulb :size="15"/> 小提示</div><p>订单确认后会出现在发货管理中。填写虚构的物流信息即可完成演示。</p></div></section></div>
    <div class="dashboard-bottom"><div class="store-summary"><span class="store-icon large">A</span><div><b>Demo Store</b><small>本地订单 · USD</small></div><span class="connected"><span class="demo-dot"></span>演示中</span></div><span class="bottom-disclaimer"><Info :size="14"/>数据为虚构示例，不代表真实经营情况</span></div>
  </template>
  <template v-else-if="page==='products'"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">商品管理</div><h1>商品</h1><p>管理店铺商品与库存信息。</p></div><button v-if="currentUser.role==='admin'" class="button button-primary" @click="openProductForm"><Plus :size="17"/>新增商品</button></div><section class="panel list-panel"><div class="list-toolbar"><div class="search-box"><Search :size="17"/><input v-model="productSearch" placeholder="搜索商品名称或 SKU"/></div><span class="result-count">共 {{filteredProducts.length}} 件商品</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table product-table"><thead><tr><th>商品</th><th>SKU</th><th>售价</th><th>库存</th><th>状态</th><th></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="product in filteredProducts" :key="product.sku" class="clickable-row" @click="selectedProduct=product"><td><div class="product-cell"><div class="product-thumb" :class="product.theme"><component :is="product.icon" :size="21"/></div><div><b>{{product.name}}</b><small class="cell-sub">{{product.category}}</small></div></div></td><td><span class="mono muted-text">{{product.sku}}</span></td><td class="amount">{{money(product.price)}}</td><td><span :class="{'low-stock-text':product.stock<=product.threshold}">{{product.stock}} 件</span></td><td><span :class="['status-badge',product.active?'status-completed':'status-cancelled']"><i></i>{{product.active?'在售':'已下架'}}</span></td><td><ChevronRight :size="16" class="muted"/></td></tr><tr v-if="!filteredProducts.length"><td colspan="6"><div class="empty-state"><Package :size="30"/><b>没有找到商品</b><span>试试其他名称或 SKU</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></template>
  <template v-else-if="page==='users'&&currentUser.role==='admin'"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">系统设置</div><h1>用户与权限</h1><p>按岗位分配订单操作权限；停用账户会立即撤销其登录会话。</p></div><button class="button button-primary" @click="openUserForm"><Plus :size="17"/>新增用户</button></div><section class="panel list-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>工作区成员</h2><p>密码只存储为安全哈希，不会在列表中显示</p></div><span class="panel-count">{{users.length}}</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table user-table"><thead><tr><th>用户</th><th>角色</th><th>状态</th><th>创建时间</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="user in users" :key="user.id"><td><div class="user-name-cell"><span class="avatar">{{user.username.slice(0,1).toUpperCase()}}</span><b>{{user.username}}</b><small v-if="user.id===currentUser.id">当前账号</small></div></td><td><select class="role-select" :value="user.role" :disabled="user.id===currentUser.id" @change="updateUser(user,{role:$event.target.value})"><option value="admin">管理员</option><option value="operator">运营</option><option value="viewer">只读</option></select></td><td><span :class="['status-badge',user.active?'status-completed':'status-cancelled']"><i></i>{{user.active?'启用':'已停用'}}</span></td><td>{{formatDate(user.createdAt)}}</td><td><button class="table-action" :disabled="user.id===currentUser.id" @click="updateUser(user,{active:!user.active})">{{user.active?'停用':'重新启用'}}</button></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class="panel list-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>权限变更记录</h2><p>最近的账号创建、角色调整、停用与重新启用记录</p></div><span class="panel-count">{{userAuditEvents.length}}</span></div><div v-if="userAuditEvents.length" class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>时间</th><th>操作人</th><th>目标账号</th><th>变更</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="event in userAuditEvents" :key="event.id"><td>{{formatDate(event.date)}}</td><td>{{event.actor}}</td><td>{{event.target}}</td><td>{{userAuditLabel(event)}}</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div v-else class="empty-state compact"><ShieldCheck :size="24"/><b>暂无权限变更记录</b></div></section><div class="role-cards"><article class="panel role-card"><span class="role-icon role-admin"><ShieldCheck :size="18"/></span><div><b>管理员</b><p>全部数据与订单操作、用户管理及账户停用。</p></div></article><article class="panel role-card"><span class="role-icon role-operator"><ClipboardCheck :size="18"/></span><div><b>运营</b><p>查看数据、确认/取消订单、发货及完成订单。</p></div></article><article class="panel role-card"><span class="role-icon role-viewer"><Eye :size="18"/></span><div><b>只读</b><p>仅可查看商品、订单和库存数据。</p></div></article></div></template>
  <template v-else-if="page==='backups'&&currentUser.role==='admin'"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">数据保护</div><h1>备份管理</h1><p>{{DEMO_MODE?'备份保存在当前浏览器，也可下载 JSON 文件。':'SQLite 快照可在本机留存或下载到安全位置。'}}</p></div><div class="heading-actions"><button v-if="backupStatus.remoteConfigured&&backupStatus.pendingRemoteCount>0" class="button button-secondary" :disabled="backupBusy" @click="retryRemoteBackups">重试云端同步（{{backupStatus.pendingRemoteCount}}）</button><button class="button button-primary" :disabled="backupBusy" @click="createBackup"><Database :size="16"/>{{backupBusy?'正在处理…':'立即备份'}}</button></div></div><div class="backup-notice"><ShieldCheck :size="16"/><span>{{DEMO_MODE?'演示数据不会自动备份；请手动创建并下载浏览器快照。':'系统每天自动备份一次，本机最多保留 30 份。'}}{{backupStatus.remoteConfigured?'S3 兼容异地备份已启用。':(backupStatus.configurationIssue||'异地备份尚未配置，请检查 Bucket、地域、Endpoint 与 ECS RAM 角色或 AccessKey。')}}<span v-if="backupStatus.remoteConfigured&&backupStatus.pendingRemoteCount>0">当前有 {{backupStatus.pendingRemoteCount}} 份快照等待同步，系统每 30 分钟自动重试。</span>恢复前会自动创建安全副本；恢复后需要重新登录。</span></div><section class="panel list-panel backup-list"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>可用备份</h2><p>{{DEMO_MODE?'备份数据存放在当前浏览器中':'备份文件存放在本机 data/backups 目录'}}</p></div><span class="panel-count">{{backups.length}}</span></div><div v-if="backups.length" class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>文件</th><th>创建时间</th><th>大小</th><th>异地副本</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="backup in backups" :key="backup.name"><td class="mono">{{backup.name}}</td><td>{{formatDate(backup.createdAt)}}</td><td>{{formatBytes(backup.size)}}</td><td><span :class="['status-badge',backup.remoteUploaded?'status-completed':'status-cancelled']"><i></i>{{backup.remoteUploaded?'已同步':'仅本地'}}</span></td><td><span class="order-row-actions"><button class="table-action" @click="downloadBackup(backup.name)">下载</button><button class="table-action reject-action" @click="beginRestore(backup.name)">恢复</button></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div v-else class="empty-state compact"><Database :size="25"/><b>还没有数据库备份</b><span>点击“立即备份”创建第一份快照</span></div></section><RemoteBackupsPanel v-if="backupStatus.remoteConfigured" :remote="remoteBackups" :busy="backupBusy" @restore="beginRemoteRestore($event)" /><p class="inventory-footnote"><Info :size="14"/>{{DEMO_MODE?'演示备份仅保存在本浏览器，请使用“下载”另存副本。':'本地备份不能替代异地副本。云端部署后应将备份同步到独立对象存储。'}}</p></template>
  <template v-else-if="page==='orders'"><div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">订单管理</div><h1>订单</h1><p>查看订单详情并推进履约状态。</p></div><span class="page-meta"><span class="demo-dot"></span>本地订单</span></div><section class="panel list-panel"><div class="list-toolbar order-toolbar"><div class="search-box"><Search :size="17"/><input v-model="orderSearch" placeholder="搜索订单号"/></div><div class="filter-select-wrap"><ListFilter :size="16"/><select v-model="orderStatusFilter"><option value="all">所有状态</option><option value="processing">待处理</option><option value="ready">待发货</option><option value="shipped">已发货</option><option value="completed">已完成</option><option value="cancelled">已取消</option></select><ChevronDown :size="14"/></div><span class="result-count">共 {{filteredOrders.length}} 笔订单</span></div><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>订单号 / 下单时间</th><th>店铺</th><th>目的国家</th><th>商品件数</th><th>订单金额</th><th>订单状态</th><th>操作</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="order in filteredOrders" :key="order.id" class="clickable-row" @click="openOrder(order.id)"><td><b class="mono">{{order.id}}</b><small class="cell-sub">{{formatDate(order.date)}}</small></td><td><span class="store-cell">手动录入</span></td><td>{{flagFor(order.country)}} {{order.country}}</td><td>{{itemCount(order)}} 件</td><td class="amount">{{money(order.total)}}</td><td><span :class="['status-badge',statusClass(order.status)]"><i></i>{{statusLabel(order.status)}}</span></td><td><span v-if="canOperate&&['processing','ready'].includes(order.status)" class="order-row-actions"><button v-if="order.status==='processing'" class="table-action" @click.stop="confirmOrder(order)">确认</button><button class="table-action reject-action" @click.stop="beginCancel(order)">{{order.status==='processing'?'拒绝':'取消'}}</button></span><button v-else class="table-action" @click.stop="openOrder(order.id)">查看详情</button></td></tr><tr v-if="!filteredOrders.length"><td colspan="7"><div class="empty-state"><Inbox :size="30"/><b>没有符合条件的订单</b><span>调整搜索或筛选条件试试</span></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section></template>
  <template v-else-if="page==='order-detail'&&selectedOrder"><div class="detail-top"><button class="back-link" @click="navigate('orders')"><ArrowLeft :size="16"/>返回订单列表</button><span class="detail-date">下单于 {{formatDate(selectedOrder.date)}}</span></div><div class="detail-title-row"><div><div class="title-with-status"><h1 class="mono">{{selectedOrder.id}}</h1><span :class="['status-badge',statusClass(selectedOrder.status)]"><i></i>{{statusLabel(selectedOrder.status)}}</span></div><p>手动录入 · {{flagFor(selectedOrder.country)}} {{selectedOrder.country}}</p></div><div class="detail-actions"><button v-if="['processing','ready'].includes(selectedOrder.status)" class="button button-danger" @click="beginCancel(selectedOrder)"><X :size="16"/>取消订单</button><button v-if="canOperate&&selectedOrder.status==='processing'" class="button button-primary" @click="confirmOrder(selectedOrder)"><Check :size="16"/>确认订单</button><button v-if="canOperate&&selectedOrder.status==='ready'" class="button button-primary" @click="navigate('shipments')"><Truck :size="16"/>前往发货</button><button v-if="canOperate&&selectedOrder.status==='shipped'" class="button button-primary" @click="completeOrder(selectedOrder)"><CheckCircle2 :size="16"/>标记已完成</button><button class="button button-secondary" @click="showToast('订单信息已是最新状态')"><Download :size="16"/>导出订单</button></div></div><div class="detail-layout"><div class="detail-main"><section class="panel progress-panel"><div class="section-heading"><div><h2>订单进度</h2><p>从接单到完成的履约状态</p></div></div><div class="progress-track"><div v-for="(step,i) in progressSteps" :key="step" :class="['progress-step',{done:progressIndex(selectedOrder.status)>i,current:progressIndex(selectedOrder.status)===i,blocked:selectedOrder.status==='cancelled'}]"><span class="progress-dot"><Check v-if="progressIndex(selectedOrder.status)>i" :size="12"/><span v-else>{{i+1}}</span></span><b>{{step}}</b><span v-if="i<3" class="progress-line"></span></div></div><div v-if="selectedOrder.status==='cancelled'" class="cancelled-note">此订单已取消，不能继续发货。<span v-if="selectedOrder.cancelReason">取消原因：{{selectedOrder.cancelReason}}</span></div><div v-if="selectedOrder.inventoryNeedsReview" class="inventory-review-note"><TriangleAlert :size="15"/>这笔旧订单未能安全预占库存，不能发货。请先取消订单，或调整库存后重新处理。</div></section>
    <section v-if="selectedOrder.events?.length" class="panel audit-panel"><div class="panel-heading"><div><h2>操作记录</h2><p>订单状态、处理账号及原因</p></div><span class="panel-count">{{selectedOrder.events.length}}</span></div><div class="audit-list"><div v-for="event in selectedOrder.events.slice().reverse()" :key="event.id" class="audit-row"><span class="audit-dot"></span><div class="audit-content"><div class="audit-heading"><b>{{orderEventLabel(event.type)}}</b><time>{{formatDate(event.date)}}</time></div><small>操作账号：{{event.changedBy||'系统'}}</small><p v-if="event.reason">{{event.reason}}</p></div></div></div></section>
